{"title":"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2d9207c023fa4fb2454fbd1e27c938b3c026744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\frac 53-\\frac 13)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc55f7a09b3dbd2d24cf0b2d2afe4b0146c2428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/badf6498f83d366ec39c6964527b85c172ddb82b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{1}{3}) = 3(\\frac{5 - 1}{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"165\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/3/e43075b966514bcf7cf4e62665f05d62e667b7ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4bc2d976c36ea101810c663ec810daeae5922a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efe0dd2c56be6dba597a2f83bf83b5f960678c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{1}{3}) = 3 \\times \\frac{5}{3} - 3 \\times \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c995a7c51e4ba627ce5e90d53ac0d4274c6e3913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=5 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4bc2d976c36ea101810c663ec810daeae5922a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat\">2024 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Pr